# 2026-09-05 -- seven util-linux 2.42.1-r0 advisories (libblkid, libmount, libuuid) in the
# python:3.14.7-alpine base. Trivy reports the fix as 2.42.3-r0, but on this
# date the Alpine v3.24 repository still offers only 2.42.1-r0 (the fixed
# package exists in edge alone), so `apk upgrade` cannot reach it. Both CVEs
# are in the `mount`/`nsenter` helpers, which this container never runs.
# Remove these lines the day `apk policy libblkid` in the base shows 2.42.3-r0
# (the Dockerfile's whole-base `apk upgrade` then picks it up unaided).
CVE-2026-53612
CVE-2026-53613
CVE-2026-53614
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
